1
00:00:00,874 --> 00:00:05,744
(Leonard:)And in the corner, chained to the wall,
you see a bloodied and beaten Santa Claus.

2
00:00:05,912 --> 00:00:09,542
He says, "Ho, ho, help me."

3
00:00:09,716 --> 00:00:13,916
(Howard:)Yes, we found Santa. Christmas is saved.

4
00:00:14,087 --> 00:00:16,577
(Howard:)Don't ever tell my mother I said that.

5
00:00:18,024 --> 00:00:21,354
(Stuart:)I take out my skeleton key
and run to Santa to unchain him.

6
00:00:21,528 --> 00:00:25,188
(Sheldon:)But first I cast a spell of paralysis
on Stuart and Howard.

7
00:00:25,365 --> 00:00:27,695
(Howard:)- What are you doing?
- Can't talk, you're paralyzed.

8
00:00:28,768 --> 00:00:31,858
(Sheldon:)I get right up in Santa's big, fat face
and say:

9
00:00:32,038 --> 00:00:36,528
"Well, well, well, Jolly old Saint Nick,
we meet again.

10
00:00:36,709 --> 00:00:41,109
(Sheldon:)I believe the last time we spoke was
in the Baybrook Mall in Galveston, Texas...

11
00:00:41,281 --> 00:00:43,441
...when I was 5 years old, isn't that right?"

12
00:00:43,616 --> 00:00:45,646
(Penny:)Okay.

13
00:00:45,819 --> 00:00:48,719
(Sheldon:)My mother dragged me there
and plopped me down on your lap...

14
00:00:48,888 --> 00:00:51,258
(Sheldon:)...and you asked me
what I wanted for Christmas.

15
00:00:51,424 --> 00:00:55,884
(Sheldon:)I told you my Pop-Pop, because
that was the year my grandfather died.

16
00:00:56,062 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)I missed him and I wanted him back.

